{"id":"word:hebrew:H5254","type":"word","title":"נָסָה","subtitle":"H5254 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"to test ; by implication, to attempt","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to נָסָה (H5254) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: v.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 36 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"נָסָה (nâçâh) means to test ; by implication, to attempt First listed occurrence: 1Kgs 10 1."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"נָסָה","transliteration":"nâçâh","pronunciation":"naw-saw'","strong":"H5254","lemmaId":"hebrew:H5254","partOfSpeech":"v","forms":["וַ/יְנַסּ֣וּ","לְ/נַסּ֥וֹת","וַ/יְנַסּוּ","לְ/נַסֹּת֖/וֹ","נִסָּה֒"],"morphs":[["HC/Vpw3mp",5],["HR/Vpc",3],["HR/Vpc/Sp3ms",2],["HVpp3ms",2],["HVpp1cs",2],["HVpc",2],["HVpv2ms",1],["HC/Vpw3ms/Sp3mp",1],["HTi/Vpp3ms",1],["HVpi2mp",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"to test ; by implication, to attempt","usage":"adventure, assay, prove, tempt, try.","full":"H5254. nasah [ נָסָה ] verb Pi`el test, try (Late Hebrew id. , Pi`el; ᵑ7 Pa`el נַסִּי ; Syriac Pa`el ; compare Ethiopic temptation ); — Pi`el Perfect 3masculine singular נִסָּה Deut 4:34 3 t.; suffix נִסָּהוּ Exod 15:25 ; 3 feminine singular נִסְּתָה Deut 28:56 ; 1 singular נִסִּיתִי Eccl 7:23 , + 4 t. Perfect; Imperfect 3masculine singular suffix יְנַסֵּם Dan 1:14 ; 1 singular אֲנַסֶּה Judg 6:39 ; suffix אֲנַסְּכָה Eccl 2:2-3 ;masculine plural יְנַסּוּ Num 14:22 ; 2 masculine plural תְּנַסּ֑וּן Exod 17:2 , + 7 t. Imperfect; Imperative נַס Dan 1:12 ; suffix נַסֵּנִי Psa 26:2 ; Infinitive construct נַסּוֺת Exod 20:20 , + 8 t. Infinitive; Participle מְנַסֶּה Deut 13:4 ; &#8212; 1 test, try (synonym בחן ), absolute 1Sam 17:39 (a sword); with בְּ Judges 7:39; Eccl 2:1 ; with accusative Dan 1:12 , 14 ; accusative + בְּ 1Kin 10:1 2Chr 9:1 ; Eccl 7:23 . 2 attempt, assay, try to do a thing, with Infinitive Deut 4:34 ; 28:56 ; with accusative Job 4:2 ( venture a word). 3 test, try, prove, tempt [but not in modern sense of the word: see Dr Deut 6:16 ; Psalms 453, 483] a. God tests or proves Abraham Gen 22:1 (E), Israel Exod 15:25 ; 20:20 (E), 16:4 (J), Deut 8:2 , 16 ; 13:4 ; with בְּ Judg 2:22 ; 3:1 , 4 ; tribe of Levi Deut 33:8 (poem); Hezekiah 2Chr 32:31 ; psalmist Psa 26:2 . b. Israel tests , or tries God: Exod 17:2 , 7 ; Num 14:22 (J), Deut 6:16 ; Psa 78:18 ; 78:41 ; 78:56 ; 95:9 ; 106:14 ; so Ahaz, Isa 7:12 .","rootNote":"a primitive root;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Kgs 10 1","keyReferences":["1Kgs 10 1","1Sam 17 39","1Sam 17 39","2Chr 9 1","2Chr 32 31","Dan 1 12","Dan 1 14","Deut 4 34"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":36,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Kgs 10 1","book":"1Kgs","chapter":10,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לְ/נַסֹּת֖/וֹ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Vpc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"1Sam 17 39","book":"1Sam","chapter":17,"verse":39,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"נִסָּה֒","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVpp3ms"},{"reference":"1Sam 17 39","book":"1Sam","chapter":17,"verse":39,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"נִסִּ֑יתִי","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVpp1cs"},{"reference":"2Chr 9 1","book":"2Chr","chapter":9,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לְ/נַסּוֹת֩","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Vpc"},{"reference":"2Chr 32 31","book":"2Chr","chapter":32,"verse":31,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לְ/נַ֨סּוֹת֔/וֹ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Vpc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"Dan 1 12","book":"Dan","chapter":1,"verse":12,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"נַס","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVpv2ms"},{"reference":"Dan 1 14","book":"Dan","chapter":1,"verse":14,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/יְנַסֵּ֖/ם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vpw3ms/Sp3mp"},{"reference":"Deut 4 34","book":"Deut","chapter":4,"verse":34,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הֲ/נִסָּ֣ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTi/Vpp3ms"},{"reference":"Deut 6 16